  {
   "id": "the-day-before-142901@1.0.2",
   "gameId": "the-day-before-142901",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.2",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-12-08T22:19:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings, dear players! In this hotfix, we addressed the most critical issues with the game and improved overall performance. Now, you will encounter the infected more often and receive 5 times more Woodcoins for completing the tasks. Read the full changelog below!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch 1.0.2 Changelog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "• Improved game and net code performance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improved the mechanics of the spawning of the infected to increase the chance of encountering them in the world",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Improved first and third-person shooting performance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Increased task rewards from 1000 to 5000 Woodcoins",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Adjusted the amount of ammo that can be found from the dead infected",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Added option to change the keys for tilting the character left and right",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed various ways of duplicating items",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed that the alarm sound could play indefinitely",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed that one of the backpacks could disappear when swapping backpacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed that after going to the main menu from the tutorial, it was possible to appear in Leonard's room while the current quest target was already out of the room",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed that GPS Map control was not performed with the same buttons as character control",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Small fixes to the Storage to prevent items from being lost",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Small fixes to prevent spawning outside of Leonard's room",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Small fixes to resolution settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Small sound improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Small localization fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're continuing to monitor the situation and collect all the bugs that you send in our Discord. Thank you for playing the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
